#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5126
msgid "Git Worktree Directory"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5128
msgid ""
"Description: Directory where git worktrees are created, relative to the "
"repository working directory."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5129
msgid "Setting: `git.worktree_directory`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5130
msgid "Default: `\"../worktrees\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5132
msgid ""
"When the resolved directory falls outside the project root, the project's "
"directory name is automatically appended so that sibling repos don't "
"collide. For example, with the default `\"../worktrees\"` and a project at "
"`~/code/zed`, worktrees are created under `~/code/worktrees/zed/`."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5134
msgid ""
"When the resolved directory is inside the project root, no extra component "
"is added (it's already project-scoped)."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5136
msgid "**Examples**:"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5138
msgid "`\"../worktrees\"` — `~/code/worktrees/<project>/` (default)"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5139
msgid "`\".git/zed-worktrees\"` — `<project>/.git/zed-worktrees/`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5140
msgid "`\"my-worktrees\"` — `<project>/my-worktrees/`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5142
msgid "Trailing slashes are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5147
msgid "\"worktree_directory\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:5147
msgid "\"../worktrees\""
msgstr ""

